  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What does A to Z Furniture Polish do?",
      "answer": "A to Z Furniture Polish is a furniture store and furniture polishing workshop in Jogeshwari West, Mumbai. We sell modern furniture, make custom furniture, and provide professional furniture polishing, refinishing and restoration."
    },
    {
      "question": "Where are you located and which areas do you serve?",
      "answer": "We are at Gala No. 312, Sahara Building, Near SRK Hospital, Oshiwara, Jogeshwari West, Mumbai 400102. We serve Mumbai, including Oshiwara, Jogeshwari West and Andheri West."
    },
    {
      "question": "How much does furniture polishing cost?",
      "answer": "Polishing starts from ₹999 for a 2 seater sofa frame, ₹1,999 for chairs, ₹2,999 for a sofa bed and ₹3,999 for dining tables, beds and wardrobes. The final price depends on the size and condition of the furniture, and we give a free quote."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I get a quote for polishing?",
      "answer": "Send us a photo of your furniture on WhatsApp at +91 81085 82270 or call us. We look at the condition and recommend the right polishing or refinishing service."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can you make custom furniture?",
      "answer": "Yes. Share your idea, measurements or a reference image and we design the furniture around your space. The process is simple: discuss, create, deliver."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which furniture can you polish or restore?",
      "answer": "We polish and restore wooden furniture such as sofa frames, chairs, dining tables, beds, sofa beds, TV units, wardrobes and kitchen shelves."
    },
    {
      "question": "How long does delivery take?",
      "answer": "Each product page shows an estimated delivery time. For the listed furniture it ranges from about 7 to 25 days depending on the piece. For custom work, timing is confirmed after we discuss your requirements."
    }
